WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.125
Replay a probe. This is the real map, not a chat box.

00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:08.150
Pick probe seven, from the chunk family.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:17.150
Watch its guided path light up. Three thousand seven hundred eleven parents scored, twenty-nine children, sixty-nine atoms.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:23.525
Guided scores point four. Flat scores zero. Recorded rows, matched work.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:32.025
And when flat wins, we show that too. Probe eighty-three, leave-source-out: guided zero, flat point two.

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:39.025
Every state is a link. Copy it, share it, anyone sees this exact replay.

00:00:40.225 --> 00:00:46.800
Airplane mode on.  It still replays. Everything runs from the recorded files.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.675
One command re-checks all one hundred twenty probes from the staged files.
